              "html": "Plain or fancy, remember buttonholes just allow the wearer to close their garment.  It's important to plan and practice the method you will be using before you start knitting your sweater.<br>A popular option is to create your buttonholes with the sewing machine.  Use a stabilizer and treat your knitting as you would any other fabric to make openings for your buttons.",
